window.products.push({"id":816040,"name":"3 Pack (3 sizes) European Hemp Cloth w/ Hanger Loop (edge Sewn w/ Linen threads). Multipurpose Natural Hemp: Strainer Cloth, Cheesecloth, Tofu Cloth, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1cJ13ZepoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★ FABRIC & LOOP: 100% Hemp, medium weight fabric. SEWING THREADS: 100% Linen (flax). All Materials are: unbleached, unprocessed, undyed, and free of any synthetics. Our hemp is grown without any pesticides in organic soil. Only water is used to processes the hemp fiber/fabric, as evidence the bag has the NATURAL HEMP COLOR & still smells hempy. The hemp smell will disappear after a few washes. Hemp is rougher than cotton, but hemp will soften with use. If your hemp is soft & almost white, it is ★ BUYER WARNING! Most other Hemp Strainer Cloth or Nut Milk Bags are sewn with POLYESTER Or NYLON threads! Polyester/Nylon thread is not a solid thread, it is made from many very thin fibers (plastic) that are wrapped into a single thread, that easily frays & gets into your body from food. Also, many other brands (mostly Made in China) falsely claim \"Organic Hemp\" but currently there is no commercially available organic hemp. Verify my claim by searching the GOTS public database. ★ SIZE: Large 21\"x21\", Medium 15.5\"x15.5\", Small 10x10\". Minor shrinkage will occur naturally. Either Large & Medium size can be used as both sizes are designed to fit strainers up to 10\" (no need for special \"tofu box\" to make tofu or nut cheese) or use them as Strainer Cloth, Cheesecloth, Tofu Cloth, Dish Towel, Hand Towel, Washcloth, Dishcloth, Exfoliating Cloth (hemp exfoliates very well). Small size is best for body or face exfoliating or as washcloth for body or dishes. ★ PLASTIC-FREE & MOST ECO-FRIENDLY PACKAGING: Eliminating both plastic pollution and harm to wildlife. Bio-film NatureFlex cellophane bag (made from sustainable cellulose, not polluting petrochemicals), post consumer recycled paper envelope & label. (Note: if you chose the FBA (Fulfillment by Amazon) option, we can not control any extra Amazon packaging). ★ SEWN IN THE USA from all European Materials. ★ FREE BONUSES: Dairy Alternative Recipes and Tips, Support Group for DIY Dairy Alternatives and Healthy Vegan Recipes - all links are printed on the included product sheet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1cJ13ZepoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EcoPeaceful","source_asin":"B015E541AK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816040","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015E541AK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015E541AK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
