window.products.push({"id":816045,"name":"HOUSE DAY Shelf Liners for Kitchen Cabinets 17.5\" x 30FT, Drawer Liners Fridge Mats Washable Cabinet and Drawer Liner Roll Double Sided EVA Non-Slip N","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cSvbBgAfS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Drawer Protection & Reducing Slipping: Measures 12inch x 20FT. with a non-slip double-sided mat, the drawer liners help avoid spills in storage places, by keeping your items locked in place. The quatrefoil design of this liner is not only beautiful but also effective to secure your belongings and drawer from abrasion, tearing. Safe & Reusale: This kitchen, bedroom drawer, cabinet, shelf, fridge and general storage shelf liner is made of BPA-free, tasteless food-graded EVA material which is durable enough to reuse, moisture-proof,stable and non deformation under -40℃, for your safety. Waterproof & Non-skid & Easy to Clean: The fridge liner is waterproof and Oil-proof which keeps your cabinet, drawer, refrigerator from slimy, greasy,avoid cupboard damage caused by damp water. The non-adhesive shelf liners are easily removable and can be cleaned with mild soap and water. Non-slip design sticker on the bottom allows your kitchen supplies to stay organized, in place and on the shelves. Easy Installation: Comes in the most popular pre-cut sizes for easy installation. For unique sizes and shapes, you can simply trim the liner with household scissors. Just place the liner down in your drawer or cabinet and trim off any excess material. Plus, the liners are non-adhesive and easily removable. Widespread Use: The shelf liners can not only be used as a kitchen liner to ensure the clean of the home, but also as a refrigerator mat to keep food and fruits fresh. HOUSE DAY shelf liner mats is applicable to your kitchen cabinets, pantry, work station, bedroom drawers, bookshelf, storerooms, office space and shoes rack. We've seen them utilised as fridge liners (fridge shelves mats), sink mats, cutlery drawer liners, shelf paper and placemat ,coasters, enhance beauty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cSvbBgAfS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOUSE DAY","source_asin":"B08T1Z7RWS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816045","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T1Z7RWS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T1Z7RWS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":816046,"name":"CLEVAST CL-AP220 Air Purifier Replacement Filter, 3-in-1 Pre-Filter, H13 True HEPA Filter, High-Efficiency Activated Carbon Filter, 1 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GD6brYOQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PROTECT YOUR INVESTMENT: This is the recommended filter replacement for CLEVAST AP220 Air Purifier（ASIN：B091F4K7WS）. You don't have to worry or spend time looking for the right filter. The CLEVAST AP220 H13 true HEPA filter works alongside with 3-Stage filtration that removes 99.97% air particles as small as 0.3 microns such as odors, pet dander, etc. ADVANCED 3-STAGE FILTRATION: This powerful filtration system consists of a combination of pre-filter, H13 true HEPA filter, and an activated carbon filter. Pre-filter captures large particles such as lint, hair, and pet fur. It also helps to maximize the filter’s life. The high efficient activated carbon filter and H13 true HEPA filter can remove dust, pollen, and unpleasant odors. EASY REPLACEMENT FILTER: The filter is easy to remove and replace without using any tool, ensuring you to replace your old filter in minutes. MAINTENANCE TIP: The efficiency of air purifier will decrease when the filter gets old leaving more pollutants in the air. Therefore, it is recommend to replace your filter every 3-6 months. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE: Filters are sealed to protect their service time. Please remove the plastic packaging of the new filter replacement before placing it into the air purifier! CLEVAST customer support team is here for you 24/7.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GD6brYOQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CLEVAST","source_asin":"B0BLHC1838","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816046","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLHC1838","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLHC1838","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
