window.products.push({"id":816071,"name":"!RAKRISA 50 Pcs Kraft Zipper Stand Up Air Tight Lock Pouch Bags With Window & Tear Notch | 3.5 x 5.5 Inch Heat Sealable 6 Mil Thick Heavy Duty Reseala","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NahtQULxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At Rakrisa we bring amazing values at low prices. Our bags are made from premium quality kraft paper and food grade inner liner ,  which allows them to be waterproof and moisture-proof. The versatile usage of these bags are endless, which makes them a household must have item. FAQs Does these bags holds in the scent? Absolutely. Our bags comes with two types of sealing. One involving sturdy ziplock and another involving heat sealing.  These dual seals locks in all of the air of the content inside the bags. Are these pouches reusable? Yes. Our bags are designed to be used repetitively without any notches and tears. Can I heat seal these bags? Yes you can. You do not necessarily need a heat sealer to seal the top of the bags. You can use your hair straightener or flat iron. Can these bags hold liquid? Or powder? Yes. Our bags are coated with a food grade inner liner, which prevents any liquid to leak. How can I personalize these bags? You can print on these bags or use adhesive labels. Because the outer layer of the bags is wax coated you won't be able to stamp on them.  However, you can use a sharpie to draw or write on them and personalize them to your liking. Specifications: Size: 3.5 x 5.5 inches  Quantity: 50 pieces 18 Months Warranty & 100% Money-Back Guarantee We strive to provide our customers with the awesomest experience ever. If for any reason, you don't absolutely love your bags, just message us and we'll refund your order in full. Absolutely no questions asked!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NahtQULxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"!RAKRISA","source_asin":"B07WFR415Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816071","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WFR415Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WFR415Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
