window.products.push({"id":816127,"name":"BORPRES Cooling Pillowcase,Japanese Chill-Plus Tech,Q-MAX>0.43 Cooling Fiber, Absorbs Heat Keep Cool,Double Sided Design,Idea for Hot Sleeper Night Sw","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pbiuY0LsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What You Need: Tired of not being able to enjoy a proper night sleep because of night sweats and general discomfort? The BORPRES pillowcase is the perfect choice for every light sleeper! Premium Quality Fabrics: This pillowcase is made with superior quality, highly durable extra soft fabrics, a combination of 90% micanylon and 10% PE cool fabric on the front side and 100% soft elastic knitted fabric on the back, being easy to wash and guaranteed to withstand the test of time! Choose Your Size: Our pillowcase is available in three different sizes, suitable for your individual needs. Choose from Queen 18”x27”, King 18” x32”. Comfort is Key: This lightweight pillowcase has a highly breathable, soft texture, being gentle on sensitive skin. The frontal cool fabric is perfect for night sweaters, having excellent permeability and taking away moisture without absorbing your sweat. Hidden Zipper Design - Want to look more stylish and beautiful? Our cooling pillowcases feature a hidden zipper design that you won't notice the zipper, but it allows the pillow to be securely hidden in the pillowcase and it is easy to put on and take off. Bringing you a beautiful look while making your body and mind more comfortable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pbiuY0LsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BORPRES","source_asin":"B095C9BLT5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095C9BLT5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095C9BLT5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":816128,"name":"IKAPE 58mm Espresso Tamper, Premium Barista Coffee Tamper with Calibrated Spring Loaded, 100% Stainless Steel Base Tamper Compatible with Espresso Mac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613bTbd0p1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💖 Your ESPRESSO Deserves Better - Are you tired of unbalanced coffee flavors due to uneven ground coffee? Now, for the perfectionist who wants a great espresso, you can simply use our IKAPE Retractable Tamperer to create the best-flavored espresso. It ensures that the ground coffee in your bottomless naked portafilter handle is thoroughly compacted for even and consistent pressure every time, so let your ESPRESSO coffee be better! 💖 Sturdy Tamper Tool for Baristas - We use the highest quality, 100% food-safe grade stainless steel for our tamper bases. Compared to other cheaper tamper machines, this tampered stainless steel base gives you peace of mind when making espresso. This stainless steel handle is durable and the rust-proof design ensures your diet is healthy. Pls be carefully, For a 58 mm portafilter, you need to choose 58 mm calibrated tamper(Patent(US) No: 29854604). 💖 Great for Professional Baristas - Once you taste tamped espresso from your own coffee maker, you'll forget about your local coffee shop and fall in love with hand-brewed coffee. This is the highest quality tamper to date. With this tamper, the coffee get consistent distribution and pressure every time, eliminating the key variables in making espresso and achieving even extraction, it will be your go-to espresso best accessory. 💖 Consistent Concentric Ring Coffee Surface - This calibrated tamper provides over 30 lbs of optimal mashing power. By using this espresso tamper, you will get a flat concentric ring pattern in your portafilter. Numerous tests have shown that a concentric ring ground espresso coffee surface obtained at 30 Ib strength produces a better quality espresso, and the consistency of 30 Ibs of pressure will bring a great tasting coffee experience to you. 💖 More Sizing Options - To ensure you get the best shopping experience, we offer a variety of sizes such as 51mm, 53mm, 58.35mm tamper compatible with various sizes of flat bottomless portafilter. We are confident to meet the needs of a diverse customer base and offer a one-year warranty. If at any time you found that you are not satisfied with your purchase, please contact us and we will refund 100% of the money, or you can donate to a group in need and pass on your good deed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613bTbd0p1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IKAPE","source_asin":"B0BKYHZ9WP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816128","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKYHZ9WP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKYHZ9WP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
