window.products.push({"id":816241,"name":"Cornaments Brand Tomato Vegetable Decoration Makes A Use as an Ornament, Inspiration, Cubicle Knickknack, Kitchen Decor, and More. Collect All 12. Buy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g5mcijUsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Cornaments brand TOMATO DECORATION adds a healthy helping of fun and novelty to your unique home or workspace. Our vegetable ornaments are detailed, hand-painted and amazingly realistic. This charming TOMATO replica comes with an integrated fisheye, making it easy to hang in your kitchen, cubicle or anywhere else you can imagine. Made of polyresin and very durable, it is an heirloom-quality ornament that will bring smiles year after year. This TOMATO ornament and all 12 vegetable Cornaments are the perfect gift for gardeners, foodies, chefs, home cooks, juicers, vegetable lovers and healthy eating aficionados who prioritize whole foods in their diets. Cornaments are also a great novelty gift for VALENTINES, BIRTHDAYS, AND EASTER. It’s also great for moms, dads and grandparents who often remind the children in their lives to eat their vegetables in order to grow up strong and healthy. Our goal is your total satisfaction and to create a unique niche for high-quality ornaments and decorations that can be enjoyed by vegetable lovers everywhere! Collect all 12 GIFT Ornaments while they last. Also available are our Cornaments brand Veggie Ceiling Fan Chain Pulls. The Cornaments story began when we wanted to teach our young daughter about entrepreneurship. One evening at dinner, she said, “Wouldn’t it be great if we could hang vegetables on the Christmas tree?” After an intensive year of development, here we are—a family of four demonstrating that ideas can become reality, and that we can sell those realized products to almost anyone in the world! When you buy our Cornaments brand TOMATO Decorations, you are supporting a small family business—thank you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g5mcijUsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cornaments","source_asin":"B075SD7FS7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075SD7FS7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075SD7FS7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
