window.products.push({"id":816259,"name":"BarConic® Bar Spoon - Copper Plated Cocktail Fairy - 30cm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Wl-DTjb0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This cocktail fairy bar spoon will certainly add an adorable girly element to your stirring technique! A twist off of the historic absinthe green fairy, this gorgeously reflective bar spoon showcases an exquisite copper plating. The high quality and durable stainless steel construction backed by the BarConic brand will ensure longevity and enjoyment. This bar spoon is simply a delight to use with its 30cm length stem that twists down to a smooth spoon end. Bar Spoons are a common bar tool used in historic and modern mixology. They aid in the stirring process of aromatic spirits, being careful not to water them down and preserving their robust flavors. The stirring technique is one to be appreciated as well as respected! Simply a must have in your bar tool ammo!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Wl-DTjb0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BARCONIC","source_asin":"B07CTV6F17","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816259","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CTV6F17","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CTV6F17","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
