window.products.push({"id":816289,"name":"DBLR Biodegradable Plastic Grocery Bags with Handles (100 Count) Made from Corn - Extra Thick .98 Mil - Eco Friendly Plastic Thank You Bags - Durable ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71otAdIU2mL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Be responsible for the environment by using zero waste durable biodegradable plastic bags with handles that are 25 microns thick and made from corn starch. That is 2x the thickness of most other plastic grocery bags. These bags are not only biodegradable but 100% compostable and certified by the Biodegradable Products Institute (BPI). They meet US ASTM D6400 standards. It is important to know that you should NOT recycle a product that is compostable. If a product says recycle and compost, you are being misled. You should compost the shopping bags and allow them to fully decompose within approximately 4 months when placed in a proper compost pile. Protect sea life by composting each thank you bag. Show appreciation to your customers by using well-made plastic shopping bags with handles that are attractive and do not leak. These plastic shopping bags for small business are great for carrying groceries, retail thank you shopping bags, or restaurant take out plastic bags. You can also use them as dog poop bags, for food scrap, or outdoor camping. The dimensions of these thank you plastic bags with handles are 19 x 11 x 6 inches. Packed in bundles of 100. Start saving the sea turtles and get your biodegradable grocery bags today. They will thank you for it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71otAdIU2mL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DBLR","source_asin":"B0BLYK9VZR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816289","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLYK9VZR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLYK9VZR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
