window.products.push({"id":816357,"name":"Digital Kitchen Scales, Accurate 0.01g-500g Electronic Cooking Food Scales, Weighing Pocket Scales Measuring in lb/oz/gr/kg with Back-Lit Display, Tar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SvZHP63KL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"If you are seeking out a nicely priced and accurate digital pocket scale, here you got the right one. KozyOne digital scale should be your perfect choice! ♥Our digital pocket scale comes with 2 AAA batteries, 2 trays and 1 user manual, which means that saves your costs and enjoys a longer time in one purchase. ♥Designed in a proper size with ultralight weight, make it easy to use and carry; Made of a high-quality stainless steel platform and ABS plastic frame, more compact, durable and user-friendly. ♥Our switching units provide most common measurement units, which enables you to get an accurate reading on anything you want. Note: All items must be of uniform weight for the counting feature to work. 1. Turn on the scale. 2. Press and hold the PCS button until you see PCS flash on the top left cornerof the lcd display, and a sample count(25) displayed. 3. Press the M button until the display shows the sample count youwant(available sample counts are 25/50/60/75/100), then place the sample counton the platform same as the lcd shows, and press PCS button to confirm. 4. Press PCS button again for counting, you may now place any number of theitems on the scale, lcd will display a count. Specification: Weight Capacity: 500g Function Buttons: Power / Mode / PCS / Tare Measurement Units: G, OZ, OZT, DWT, CT, GN Calibration: Auto Calibration Package Dimension: 13.00 x 3.3 x 16 cm What’ s In the Box: 1 x Mini Digital Pocket Scale 1 x User Manual 2 x AAA Batteries 2 x Trays(Large Clear Square Bowl+Small Clear Square Bowl)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SvZHP63KL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Reokme","source_asin":"B07C7N2VW3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816357","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C7N2VW3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C7N2VW3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
