window.products.push({"id":816369,"name":"DOZ Premium Eucalyptus Mattress Protector, 100% Waterproof, Noiseless, Ultra Soft, Cooling, 3D Air Fabric Breathable Bed Mattress Cover, 16 Inch Deep ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61reWw3QGpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SIJO is a bedding brand expertly crafted from innovative materials. Our mission and products have gained us numerous awards and industry recognition. Now, we’re bringing that same expertise and passion for sleep products to DOZ by SIJO. Rest well knowing that DOZ, backed by the SIJO brand, will feature high quality, well-crafted, and well priced items to help you achieve better sleep night after night. Cooling: 100% Eucalyptus Tencel lyocell surface with 100% recycled polyester backing. This protector is designed with comfort and cooling in mind, making it an ideal protector for your mattress through all four seasons. The fabric also has natural cooling properties, offering better ventilation than other competing waterproof protectors. 100% Protection: The protector is 100% waterproof protection with advanced double TPU Backing. The protector has a waterproof design that protects mattresses from spills, stains, and nighttime accidents. Many waterproof protectors can feel stiff or crinkly, but this model is made with a bamboo-derived rayon fabric that is soft to the touch and makes little noise when you move around. Noiseless: Many waterproof protectors can feel stiff or crinkly, but this model is made with Tencel eucalyptus lyocell fabric that is soft to the touch and makes no noise when you move around. Deep Pocket: 16 inch Deep Pocket can fit mattresses up to 20 inches, prevent the mattress from moving. With its fitted-sheet-style design, the protector covers the surface and four sides of the mattress.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61reWw3QGpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOZ by SIJO","source_asin":"B0BBSD4L1H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816369","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBSD4L1H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBSD4L1H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
