window.products.push({"id":816502,"name":"Crucible Cookware Silicone Hot Handle Holder (2-Pack Mix Turquoise)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rsd7Moc9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The secret of how to protect your hands when cooking with cast iron skillets or pans, so that you don't forget about the heat and grab the fiery hot handle of the skillet by mistake Premium quality pan handle for optimal hand protection - Highest premium quality material available - Dishwasher safe - Protect your hands from -104 ºF to 464 ºF (-40°C to 240°C) - Slide onto pan handle - No rubber smell when heated - A hole on the back to hang on - Fits most brands including Caphalon, La cuisine, Lodge, Le Creuset, Cuisinart, Wagner. Makes Cooking With Cast Iron Cookware Easy, Safe and Fun - You can have the silicone sleeve on the whole time when cooking on the stove so you don't grab the cast iron by mistake. - Takes up very little space in your drawer. - Secure, comfortable and stable grip. Heat reducing and enhanced grip with internal silicone ribbing gives the potholder extra protection for your hands. - 5-5/8-inch by 2-inch - BPA Free The major advantage of having a removable silicone hot handle holder opposed to having a permanent protective handle cover on the skillet is that it enables using a cast-iron skillet in hot oven without ruining the handle. The silicone handle should be taken off the cookware when putting it into a hot oven. If used with gas stove, be extra careful so that the handle holder don’t come too close to the flame which might ruin the handle cover. For a lesser size, please refer to the Small Size Silicone Hot Handle Holder, also included in the Set Of 3 and Set Of 5. Click the \"Add to Cart\" button on the Top of this page to Protect your hands Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rsd7Moc9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crucible Cookware","source_asin":"B01N36YJ09","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816502","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N36YJ09","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N36YJ09","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":816503,"name":"Artland Berry Basket, Blue, Pack of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rd4dL+tWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Artland Berry Baskets are a great addition to any fridge or kitchen. Designed after the classic paper berry basket, this ceramic version is just the right size to hold a variety of different types of berries. Perfect for storing your berries from the farmers market, a meal on the patio, or for adding a little color to your fridge and countertop space. The berry baskets come as a set of four, so you can even create a fun berry-themed desert to serve with dinner. These baskets are shaped like berry baskets, but can be used for a variety of fun storage purposes in your kitchen or the rest of your home. Unlike their paper predecessors, these ceramic baskets allow you to rinse and wash your fruit right in the basket.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rd4dL+tWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARTLAND","source_asin":"B00DQYXOBO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816503","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DQYXOBO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DQYXOBO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
