window.products.push({"id":816507,"name":"6\" x 6\" Moisture-proof and Nonstick Square Dry Wax Papers, Microwave and Freezer Safe for Ground Beef, Burger Patties, 250 Pieces, By Srenta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ym4jAl3IL._AC_.jpg","description":"About the SRENTA 6\" x 6\" Moisture-proof and Nonstick Square Dry Wax Papers, Microwave and Freezer Safe for Ground Beef, Burger Patties, 250 Pieces. For cooks, bakers and candy makers, wax paper is the secret weapon for keeping food from sticking. Lined with a thin layer of wax on each side, wax paper is designed to keep food fresh longer. Moisture-proof and nonstick, wax paper won’t stick to fresh foods or freeze to meat. Ideal for preparing hamburgers and filets for easy separation. Perfect for wrapping or separating gooey baked goods, rice crispy treats and candies prior to storing. Also a perfect way to let your cheese breathe while keeping it fresh. Handy, versatile and helpful, even outside the kitchen! Features : Moisture-proof and nonstick, wax paper won’t stick to fresh foods or freeze to meat  Lined with a thin layer of wax on each side. Wax paper is designed to keep food fresh longer. Made up of premium quality materials. Package Details : 250 Pieces Square Dry Wax Papers Specifications : Measures: 6\" x 6\"  Assembled product weight: 0.5lb Color: White Quantity: 250 Pieces Use for: Ideal for preparing burgers and filets for easy separation.  Perfect for candy making and wrapping. This SRENTA 6\" x 6\" Moisture-proof and Nonstick Square Dry Wax Papers are perfect way to let your cheese breathe while keeping it fresh. Buy it, Try it, LOVE it!!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ym4jAl3IL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Srenta","source_asin":"B07N1TJ87D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816507","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N1TJ87D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N1TJ87D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":816508,"name":"Cybrtrayd Life of the Party Safety Pins Chocolate Candy Mold in Sealed Protective Poly Bag Imprinted with Copyrighted Cybrtrayd Molding Instructions","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DEy8-iKGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DEy8-iKGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B000EGAQ86","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EGAQ86","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EGAQ86","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
