window.products.push({"id":816567,"name":"BROLEX Extra Large 38'' Stuffed Animals Bean Bag Chair Cover-100% Cotton Canvas Kids Toy Storage Zipper Bags Comfy Pouf for Unisex Boys Girls Toddlar,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H-fqxmoOL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Ultimate Storage stuffed animal Bean bag Cover Has Just Been Released! Parents Wait No More! Fed up with floors full of toys? stepping on stuffed animals all the time? kids’ toys taking over the room? cheaply made beanbag chairs? small toy boxes and bulky storage chests? If so, then Brolex has something really interesting for you. The finest storage and organizer bean bag cover. Piles of Toys Tuck Them All In A Brolex Oversized Bean bag Cover! Stop tormenting yourself with small size storage bags. Invest in a Brolex stuffed animal bean bag cover and organize even the tiniest space. Being oversized yet compact, this storage bag can hold anything that comes to mind. From stuffed animals, plush toys, pretend play gear, puzzles, drawing kits, and balls, to pillows, quilts, blankets, seasonal clothing, and other pliable objects. The world is your oyster. Don’t want to use it for storage? Fill it with soft and smooth pouf inserts and create the most adorable dinosaur bean bag chair ever. Have fun with your kids, sit on top, take a quick nap and relax. Forget about the tidying nightmare. Teach your kids about the importance of organization and how to keep their rooms neat. 8 Features That Make This Bean Bag Cover & Toy Organizer Your #1 Choice: · 100% smooth and soft cotton canvas. · Playful and perky dinosaur patterns. Unisex for girls and boys. · Stuff n’ Sit beanbag. Holds your kids’ toys. · Ultra resilient yet smooth zippers! · Washable fabric. Hassle free maintenance. · Reinforced stitching. Ready for heavy duty use. · Carrying and hanging handle on top. . Extra Large size :38’’ . What are you waiting for? Scroll Up & Click Add To Cart Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H-fqxmoOL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BROLEX","source_asin":"B077MBSZJ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816567","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077MBSZJ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077MBSZJ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
