window.products.push({"id":816744,"name":"HUIMO Ottoman Bench with Removable Tray, 51-inch Storage Ottoman with Button-Tufted, Bedroom Bench Safety Hinge Ottoman in Upholstered Fabrics, Large ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":194.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711gleNZZzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SELECTED MATERIAL】 We craft every piece of our furniture with love! Our exquisite storage bench is made of cotton and linen blended fabric, which provides this piece with a smooth and flawless texture. The classic pattern on it adds fashion and beauty without compromising comfort. The inside of the bedroom bench is filled with thick high-resilient sponge, which is not easy to deform after long-term sitting, making the whole footstool more durable without sacrificing any comfort. 【REMOVABLE SERVING TRAY】Our tray are made of dark solid wood which not only demonstrate the classic charm, but also integrate modern aesthetics. With simple lines and smooth interiors, storage ottoman provides a truly appealing look, feel and design. These footstools come in two different colors, which will complement most of the furniture. This charming storage ottoman is the perfect way to add elegance to your room.Detachable top tray is included so it can be used as a coffee table to have a drink while sitting down on the ottoman to reading or relax. It is not fixed on the ottoman, therefore can be removed easily when not in use. 【EXTENSIVE USE】 Such an elegant ottoman with serving tray can be used as the ottoman coffee table to spend your leisure time, and it can also provide additional seating and storage space in your living room. Storage chest provides ample storage space for organizing pillows, blankets or magazines neatly. While bringing an elegant, classical and noble atmosphere to your entrance, living room or bedroom, it also fully demonstrates comfort and functional diversity, providing the greatest convenience for your life. 【FIRM & SECURITY】 This ottoman with storage is made of solid and engineered wood to ensure stability. It can hold up to 300 pounds of weight (static load capacity).The inside of this storage ottoman is connected by safety pressure hinges and sturdy hardware accessories.They can keep the lid always open to prevent the end of bed bench from closing suddenly, or they can gently and slowly fall when you want to close the lid, so as to ensure that you are safer and more convenient. 【WORRY-FREE ASSEMBLY】 Get wonderful time by simple assembly! Each ottoman bench will be equipped with a tool kit, including an operating manual and connecting parts required. Customer satisfaction is our top priority. While we provide you with high quality products, we also provide you with impeccable customer service that exceeds the highest industry standards. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711gleNZZzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HUIMO","source_asin":"B09LMD4L9D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LMD4L9D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LMD4L9D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
