window.products.push({"id":816814,"name":"Jolly Dinosaur Lolly Chocolate Candy Mold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51phGvUR0EL._AC_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51phGvUR0EL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B000EBMULW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816814","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EBMULW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EBMULW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":816815,"name":"WKFSBLS Insulated Water Bottle, BPA-free Double-layer Stainless Steel Water Bottles For The Gym, Outdoor Hiking, and Big Sports, Keeps Drinks Cold For","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Fl1XroL5S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️【Vacuum Insulated Double Wall Water Bottle】–The steel water bottle features double walls and a vacuum seal to ensure you experience zero condensation and that the temperature of your beverage lasts in the holding chamber. The keep water cold bottle is a 24 hour cold water bottle that keeps cold liquids cold for 20-24 hours, while the thermo flask keeps hot liquids hot for 8-12 hours, making it the perfect water bottle insulated for sports or commuting. ✔️【BPA Free Material hydro flask】 - Most cheap plastic water flask leach chemicals and change the taste of your drink when refilled. Eco-Friendly iron flask water bottle WKFSBLS metal water bottles are made with high quality, non-toxic, non-plastic water bottles that do not contain BPA, phthalates, lead or other toxic materials, making them the safest water bottles that do not leach chemicals. ✔️【PREMIUM QUALITY DESIGN AND FUNCTIONALITY】 - Easily fill your bottle with ice and clean it through the wide mouth opening. We designed the WKFSBLS bottle to look and function better than any other Stainless Steel Water Bottle。It is ergonomically shaped to make one-handed use a breeze, with perfect for hardwearing use, unlike cheap plastic that can split and crack. ✔️【LEAKPROOF and SHATTERPROOF IRON FLASK】-The water bottle is absolutely leak-proof and shatterproof, making it the choice for rough use. It can be used as your hiking water bottle, gym water bottle, bike water bottle, work water bottle, school water bottle, car water bottle, boating water bottle, and home water bottle. These bottles can be safely placed on the edge of your backpack, beach bag, or countertop. Please note: They are not dishwasher safe. ✔️【12 MONTHS WARRANTY GUARANTEE & 100% SATISFACTION】 - We have 12 month warranty, if you have any dissatisfaction with the quality of the product, please do not hesitate to contact us. And we will try our best to solve your problem and issue a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Fl1XroL5S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WKFSBLS","source_asin":"B098XTDMH3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816815","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098XTDMH3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098XTDMH3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
