window.products.push({"id":816838,"name":"BEAT B INSECTS : Personalized edible Birthday Party Cake topper decoration premium frosting sheets","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RLTiaXDKL._AC_.jpg","description":"You are purchasing an edible frosting topper measuring 7.5 x 10 inches which will fit nicely on a quarter slab cake. It also presents well centered on a half slab cake, with the slightly larger border providing an area for more creativity. If you don’t see what you are looking for, please contact the seller for further items. This is a PERSONALIZED item. It is imperative for timely shipping that you email me before ordering OR immediately after checkout, with your desired message. If no message is included I will attempt to contact you for confirmation of a message but I am time limited with my shipping policy. I will do my best to reach you but will ship the topper with just HAPPY BIRTHDAY if no contact is made. My icing toppers are an actual layer of FROSTING (not wafer or rice paper) that bonds with the icing of the cake. Just peel from the backing and place. The topper is absorbed and blends in with the cake icing. Detailed instructions will be included in the shipment. For best results the icing below the topper should be white. The rest of the cake can be a different flavour. These are extremely easy to apply. ALERTS: Kosher Certified. Gluten and Nut free. Dairy free. Contains no known allergens. SHIPPING: PLEASE DOUBLE CHECK THE ESTIMATED TIME OF DELIVERY since the SELLER cannot be responsible for missed event dates. This topper is shipped in a sturdy package. This is a food item and cannot be returned. STORAGE: If stored flat within the sealed bag, it will keep for a year. Do not refrigerate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RLTiaXDKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unique.Things","source_asin":"B072J9425V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816838","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072J9425V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072J9425V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
