window.products.push({"id":816884,"name":"De Kulture Handmade Premium Wool Felt Goat (Hanging) Eco Friendly Needle Felted Christmas Xmas Tree Decoration Stuffed Ornament for Home Office Party ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YaJ6uRgVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PURE FELT & PERFECT SIZE: Made of 100% genuine felt, this Hanging Goat ornament cum home decor figure measures 4.0\" by 2.0\" by 3\" inches (LWH). BONAFIDE DESIGN & BINARY USES: This gorgeous 100% biodegradable hanging felt decorative is perfect for your car, home or office.This hanging figurine can also be used by children to play with it. It is soft, safe and full of character. This handmade felt showpiece is a perfect precedent of the art of acceptance that India portrays, as during the British rule it set an example of Hindu-Muslim unity in India. HANDMADE & ECO-FRIENDLY: This needle felted hanging figure is environmentally kind. Our collection includes little-felt friends in vibrant animal figures such as sheep, horse, goat, reindeer and much more SOCIAL BUSINESS & NOBLE STORY: This product supports and empowers underprivileged rural women of Rajasthan, India. It preserves the rare craft of needle felting in India. Felt, or Namda, as it is locally called is said to have migrated to India from Iran and Turkey. This Namda cluster which makes this product in Rajasthan was once ruled by the 'Pathans' of Afghanistan. This cluster employs about 500 Pinjare artisans, an Indian-Persian Muslim community ASSURANCE, AUTHENTICITY & SAFETY: Quality satisfaction and timely delivery are assured. To be sure of authenticity, we recommend you to buy this product from De Kulture Works brand only. Made in India, this brand new felt Product is not safe for children. Dry clean only","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YaJ6uRgVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"De Kulture Works","source_asin":"B07SB2X458","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816884","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SB2X458","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SB2X458","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
