window.products.push({"id":816965,"name":"100 pcs 12 Inches Pearl Latex Balloons for Birthday Wedding Party Decoration and Events (Light Purple)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IHy5AJMoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Allen R Floyd 12\" Natural Latex Balloons Pack of 100  GREEN MATERIAL: The balloons are made from natural latex;No pungent odor;Non-toxicity and harmlessness. PREMIUM QUALITY:The balloons are strong and long lasting, and you won’t have to worry about them tearing or bursting when inflated. PERFECT SIZE: It is about 4.3 in x 2 in before inflated ; about 12 in x10 in after inflated.Package include : 100pcs balloons . FIT ALL PARTY OCCASIONS: Add a fresh, festive accent to a wedding, anniversary celebrations, dances, birthday parties, halloween,gender neutral baby shower, Christmas party and so on.   NOTICE Latex balloons always have a certain broken rate of about 1%-3%, some defectives in a bag is normal.  And we cannot promise every bag contains 100pcs, there is more or less some discrepancies, about 3%, please kindly understand. Latex balloons should try to avoid sharp objects. Dirty ground, direct sun radiation and excessive squeeze would easily break it. Latex balloon should not be filled with full air in summer due to high temperature. Generally, helium and hydrogen can fly 4-12 hours after inflating, so it's better to be inflated at the day of using. (Be careful when inflating with hydrogen, get away from fire or high heat place.)   WARRANTY: Not only we offer high quality products, we back them up with 12-month unconditional return guaranty and a 45-day money back guaranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IHy5AJMoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Allen R Floyd","source_asin":"B072KGWK3P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816965","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072KGWK3P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072KGWK3P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
