window.products.push({"id":816975,"name":"Drink Coasters Set of 6 | Wooden Coaster Set with Rustic Tinge Lines | Tabletop Protection, Protect Countertop and Surfaces from Water Marks or Damage","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HTTLvS66L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Coasters are an effective means of absorbing moisture as well as a means of advertising exposure. Coasters are helpful in many ways. They may be used between the cup and saucer to prevent the annoyance of “clinking” while serving. In addition, coasters will absorb spillage and avoid accidental dripping on the table cloth or patron’s clothing. A special unique Shabby Chic Design Coasters can affirm the high-quality product being used in the restaurant. Also, finely carved coasters are used to distinguish between regular and decaffeinated brands to minimize serving time and save confusion. Coasters can also be placed under glasses, plates or bowls, and used as a decoration or accessories to add the touch of elegance to the table setting. Tasteful use of coasters can help to create a favorable and lasting impression of the establishment. Benefits of coasters: Ideal for any home, nightstand, restaurant, bar, car, desk, boat, motor-van travel. Lightweight & extra good surface grip and table support. Will not slide or move your glassware. A perfect fun gift for your parents, siblings, boy or girlfriend on Christmas, birthday, fathers day, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HTTLvS66L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"India Store US","source_asin":"B08QHGHTHJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816975","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QHGHTHJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QHGHTHJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
