window.products.push({"id":816985,"name":"FunisFun 4-in-1 Nurse Tumblers with Lid, 12oz Double Walled Stainless Steel Insulated Coffee Cup Nutrition Facts Cooler Cans, Perfect Nurse Gifts for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713xXh5hbBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【4 in 1 Design】Our 4 in 1 multifunctional design nurse tumbler can hold any 12oz regular/slim cans and beer bottles, also can use as 16oz standard tumbler. Take your favorite drink with you wherever you go, keep your drink cool until the last drop. 【Long-lasting Heat Preservation】The can cooler double-layer insulation technology can keep hot or cold drinks for a long time, keep drinks/soda cans/beer bottles cold for more than 5 hours. Just what busy nurses need when trying to preserve their morning drink amidst the workload and distractions. The classic way to make your coffee, tea or cold soda last longer. 【High Quality Food Grade Material】Made of high quality 18/8 stainless steel, 100% BPA free, safe and durable, not easy to rust. Our tumblers provide a clean, non-metallic taste. Beautifully designed with clear and bright colors, it is both aesthetically pleasing and functional. 【Non-Slip & Condensation Free】Our copper wall layer creates a condensation-free exterior that won't sweat on your hands or in your bag. Can be comfortably held while allowing your hands to dry completely. The non-slip base prevents the mug from slipping and tipping over. Easy to clean. Suitable for most occasions such as office or travel. 【Perfect and Unique Nurse Gift】The detailed design with medical uniform and nurse nutrition will surprise and delight any nurse. This nurse mug is a heartwarming and practical birthday, year-end, graduation, Christmas gift, ideal for colleagues, family and friends who are practicing nurses or soon-to-be nurses.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713xXh5hbBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FunisFun","source_asin":"B0BWDLKLMJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816985","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWDLKLMJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWDLKLMJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":816986,"name":"LUCETE Stainless Steel Splatter Screen 11\" – Hot Grease Splatter Screen for Frying Pan - Oil Splash Guard - Protect your Skin from Burn & Keep Your Ki","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qevtXe06L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEEP YOUR KITCHEN CLEAN AND SAFE - Cleanliness is not only an aesthetic concern but also safety. Lucete Stainless Steel Splatter Screen keeps your skin safe from oil splashed during cooking. A clean cooking space makes cooking easier and more organized. It prevents hot oil and boiling sauce from splashing everywhere and boiled water from overflowing. So, you can cut down the number of steps for cleaning your kitchen. MADE OF PERFORATED STAINLESS STEEL - This symmetrically structured perforated splatter screen releases water vapor. It enriches a crisp texture, characteristic fried flavors and aromas, a pleasure to your taste buds. You can increase your dish value and prepare your dishes like a professional chef. This is a must-have product for those who do not want a messy kitchen anymore and those who want to serve great food. EASY TO CLEAN AND DISHWASHER SAFE - You can make it easier to clean up whenever you splash grease on the Lucete Stainless Steel Splatter Screen in contrast to other traditional splatter guard such as a mesh or silicone type. This saves your time and energy! The sticky grease will no longer make you feel bad! VERSATILITY MEETS DURABILITY & UNIVERSAL SIZES - In addition to the function of the hot grease splash guard, it is used for multiple purposes: a strainer, a steamer, or a cooling rack. It releases hot water vapor preventing the water from foaming up and boiling over the pot. It is suitable for almost any size of frying pan cover or pot splatter shield lid. And it can be stored easily in narrow spaces. MAKE YOUR KITCHEN LOOK PREMIUM- Premium quality and excellent durability; Comfortable to hold and stay-cool handle; Designed and made in Korea. It would be a perfect gift, especially for those who love to cook and enjoy being in the kitchen. We pride ourselves on having THE BEST Stainless Steel Splatter Screen. Your satisfaction is guaranteed. If, for whatever reason, you are not satisfied with this product, just return it and you will get fully refunded. Click the ‘Add to Cart’ Button NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qevtXe06L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUCETE","source_asin":"B09DF63QH5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-816986","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DF63QH5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DF63QH5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
